Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?v31.1:=20schema=20conformance=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20only=20documented=20Actor=20fields/enums,=20bounded=20probe,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20no=20re-bought=20searches?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- apify/instagram-scraper: remove invented skipPinnedPosts (not in schema)
- scrapesmith/instagram-comments-scraper: sortOrder 'recent' is not an enum
  value; use documented recent_activity
- semantic_broad_probe_target: minority route again (<= half target, cap 20)
  instead of 1.5x/60 which made the global probe outweigh the sample
- post-cleaning refill and post-AI refill skip any search the collector
  already paid for (same actor + input minus count knobs)
- tests/test_v31_1_schema_conformance.py locks every planned discovery and
  comment input to the verbatim public schemas (10 tests)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FM9VfoHhfyZmxPfBDYfQjP
